<p>Gham ye barpa hai aaj asghar ka<br />
qaali jhoola hai aaj asghar ka</p>

<p>Teer zaalim se aah maidaa'n me<br />
halq chid'ta hai aaj asghar ka</p>

<p>Cheh mahine ke baad bano se <br />
saat chut'ta hai aaj asghar ka</p>

<p>Koi jaake kahe ye maadar se<br />
qoon behta hai aaj asghar ka</p>

<p>Haaye zahra ka laal leke lahu<br />
Muh pe malta hai aaj asghar ka</p>

<p>Fouje dushman bhi khoon roti hai<br />
haal aisa hai aaj asghar ka<br />
</p>